@flcnhvy Accept worst case outcome &amp; assign it a probability, which is usually very low. Now think of good things in life &amp; assign them probabilities – many are certain!

Bringing anxiety/fear to the conscious mind saps it of limbic emotional strength.

Cheery fatalism is very effective.

@RenataKonkoly @WR4NYGov It’s great that they’ve changed their tune these days, but the truth is that GM tried damn hard to kill the electric car!

