@ajtourville Russia has the ability to destroy USA &amp; Europe utterly with nuclear missiles in less than 30 minutes &amp; vice versa.

A surprising number of people don’t know this.

Of course, it would be MAD to use them, but it is also MAD to be in this situation at all.

@ajtourville Would be great if someday humanity stopped pointing nukes at itself that would destroy almost all life on Earth.

